{"id":"a4dd694ba50eaccd","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-ls-category.md","title":"Lusternik–Schnirelmann Category","display":"df-ls-category — Lusternik–Schnirelmann Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ls-category","aliases":["58-df-ls-category"],"display":"df-ls-category — Lusternik–Schnirelmann Category","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ls-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ls-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ls-category — Lusternik–Schnirelmann Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal T,k\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal T,k\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (continuous-map predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ContractibleIn}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ContractibleIn}_S\\)</span> (contractibility-in-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> relation defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S\\)</span> (finite categorical-cover predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LSCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LSCategory}_S\\)</span> (unnormalized Lusternik–Schnirelmann-category relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\">\\(\\mathrm{StandardRealSubspaceTopology}_S([0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" href=\"?note=3b5b3d48ff1ff369\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md\">../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S:V^4\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S:V^4\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contractible\\text{-}in}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ContractibleIn}_S(U,X,\\mathcal T)\n\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq X\\land\\exists H,x_0,\\tau_U,\\tau_{U\\times I},\\vec X,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nx_0\\in X\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\tau_U=\\{W\\cap U\\mid W\\in\\mathcal T\\}\n\\land\\vec X=\\{\\langle0,U\\rangle,\\langle1,[0,1]\\rangle\\}\n\\land\\vec\\tau=\\{\\langle0,\\tau_U\\rangle,\\langle1,\\tau_{[0,1]}\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\tau_{U\\times I}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\n(U,\\tau_U,[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,U\\times[0,1],\\tau_{U\\times I},X,\\mathcal T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;\\bigl(H(\\langle u,0\\rangle)=u\\land H(\\langle u,1\\rangle)=x_0\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contractible\\text{-}in}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ContractibleIn}_S(U,X,\\mathcal T)\n\\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq X\\land\\exists H,x_0,\\tau_U,\\tau_{U\\times I},\\vec X,\\vec\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nx_0\\in X\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\tau_U=\\{W\\cap U\\mid W\\in\\mathcal T\\}\n\\land\\vec X=\\{\\langle0,U\\rangle,\\langle1,[0,1]\\rangle\\}\n\\land\\vec\\tau=\\{\\langle0,\\tau_U\\rangle,\\langle1,\\tau_{[0,1]}\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\tau_{U\\times I}=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\n(U,\\tau_U,[0,1],\\tau_{[0,1]})\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,U\\times[0,1],\\tau_{U\\times I},X,\\mathcal T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;\\bigl(H(\\langle u,0\\rangle)=u\\land H(\\langle u,1\\rangle)=x_0\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}cover}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S(m,X,\\mathcal T)\n\\leftrightarrow m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(U,m,\\mathcal T)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{i\\in m}U(i)\n\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\operatorname{ContractibleIn}_S(U(i),X,\\mathcal T)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}categorical\\text{-}cover}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S(m,X,\\mathcal T)\n\\leftrightarrow m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(U,m,\\mathcal T)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{i\\in m}U(i)\n\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;\\operatorname{ContractibleIn}_S(U(i),X,\\mathcal T)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ls\\text{-}category} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{LSCategory}_S(k,X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal T)\\land\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S(k,X,\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\forall m\\in k\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\neg\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S(m,X,\\mathcal T)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\bigl(k=\\infty\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S(m,X,\\mathcal T)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ls\\text{-}category} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{LSCategory}_S(k,X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal T)\\land\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S(k,X,\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\forall m\\in k\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\neg\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S(m,X,\\mathcal T)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor\\bigl(k=\\infty\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{CategoricalCover}_S(m,X,\\mathcal T)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Contractibility is witnessed by a continuous homotopy in the ambient space, with both subspace and generated product topologies exposed. The finite minimum and the no-finite-cover case are separated, so the external symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> is never mixed into an ordinal minimum.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cat}(X) \\leq \\dim(X) + 1\">\\(\\mathrm{cat}(X) \\leq \\dim(X) + 1\\)</span> for CW complexes.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cat}(X) \\geq \\operatorname{cuplength}(X)+1\">\\(\\mathrm{cat}(X) \\geq \\operatorname{cuplength}(X)+1\\)</span> under the unnormalized convention used here.</li>\n<li>Gives lower bounds on number of critical points of smooth functions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cat}(\\mathbb{R}^n) = 1\">\\(\\mathrm{cat}(\\mathbb{R}^n) = 1\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cat}(S^n) = 2\">\\(\\mathrm{cat}(S^n) = 2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>If no finite categorical open cover exists, the value is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-standard-real-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (topological-space predicate; see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f